msgid "4. Prepare the Color Table"
msgstr ""

msgid "The first row must contain column headers, and each following row represents one color. Do not merge cells or add extra headings above the first row."
msgstr ""

msgid "In CSV, use commas as the column separator. In XLSX, the first worksheet is used. HEX values must be valid, and sample_image may be left empty when no image is available."
msgstr ""

