msgid "6. Find a Nearby Color"
msgstr ""

msgid "When search is enabled, the color wheel is displayed. Choose a color from the wheel and click Find Nearest. The plugin displays the nearest colors in the same color family, ordered by proximity."
msgstr ""

msgid "The color-wheel search is independent of text search. Clear the selected color to return to all results."
