msgid "6. Display, Search, Sort, and Export"
msgstr ""

msgid "Each group can define its responsive columns and choose which color fields are shown. Website visitors can search and sort colors, and administrators can export a group as CSV or XLSX."
msgstr ""

msgid "Export a group from the group editor using Export CSV or Export XLSX. The exported columns are compatible with the import template."
msgstr ""

msgid "Choose Preview Import first. The plugin validates the file and reports valid rows, duplicates, and codes already present in the group before you confirm the import."
msgstr ""

msgid "Replace all removes the current color list. Append and skip keeps existing codes unchanged. Append and update replaces matching codes and adds new ones."
msgstr ""

msgid "Click HEX or RGB on a color card to copy the value. RGB and HSL are calculated automatically from HEX."
msgstr ""

msgid "A group stores default Desktop, Tablet, and Mobile columns. Shortcode attributes desktop, tablet, and mobile override the group defaults when provided."
